# The Dwarven Arena (#5; design/builds/dwarven_arena.toml, blueprints/dwarven_arena.py, arena "dwarven" of arenas.toml).
# The structure is placed at a test corner in the overworld (21000 200 21000, far from every build), the arena is moved
# there (`ttl arena testat`), so the test needs neither the real placement nor its terrain. Expect 7x Test passed for the
# block checks and no "ttl: expected ..." line. Blueprint offsets: forecourt x 0-5, door x 6 (y 1-3, z 24-26), alcove x 7-10
# (the royal warp pads stood there: now air), pit floor y 0 (you stand at y 1), spawn A 15 1 25, spawn B 43 1 25.
# Not asserted (verify in game): the real placement by the survey, the look from outside, the door and forecourt, the
# gallery on the dais, loot, the teleport back, the waves' mobs (tensura:armorsaurus, war_gnome, beast_gnome, bone_golem).
ttlbot spawn TtlBotDwA
ttlbot spawn TtlBotDwB
@sleep 2
ttl arena reset
ttl arena testmode on
ttl arena clear TtlBotDwA
ttl arena clear TtlBotDwB
kubejs stages add TtlBotDwA ttl.life2
kubejs stages add TtlBotDwB ttl.life2
execute in minecraft:overworld run forceload add 20992 20992 21088 21056
@sleep 2
# In four slabs: one fill takes at most 32768 blocks (the single 99450-block fill was refused and cleared nothing).
execute in minecraft:overworld run fill 21000 200 21000 21018 225 21050 minecraft:air
execute in minecraft:overworld run fill 21019 200 21000 21037 225 21050 minecraft:air
execute in minecraft:overworld run fill 21038 200 21000 21056 225 21050 minecraft:air
execute in minecraft:overworld run fill 21057 200 21000 21074 225 21050 minecraft:air
execute in minecraft:overworld run place template ttl:dwarven_arena 21000 200 21000
@sleep 4
# Forecourt paving, the open door, a cell where a royal warp pad stood, the standing spots and their floor.
execute in minecraft:overworld if block 21003 200 21025 minecraft:stone_bricks
execute in minecraft:overworld if block 21006 201 21025 minecraft:air
execute in minecraft:overworld if block 21008 201 21025 minecraft:air
execute in minecraft:overworld if block 21015 201 21025 minecraft:air
execute in minecraft:overworld if block 21043 201 21025 minecraft:air
# The glass shell is gone (export x 2 y 10 z 25 was black stained glass), the hall's wall is not (export x 5 y 10 z 24).
execute in minecraft:overworld unless block 21008 209 21025 minecraft:black_stained_glass
execute in minecraft:overworld unless block 21011 209 21024 minecraft:air
execute in minecraft:overworld run ttl arena testat dwarven 21000 200 21000
ttl arena list

# ---- duel: A opens, B joins, A wins ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
execute as TtlBotDwA run ttl arena join dwarven duel
execute as TtlBotDwB run ttl arena join dwarven
ttl arena expect arena dwarven state lobby
ttl arena expect arena dwarven players 2
ttl arena expect player TtlBotDwA inarena yes
execute as TtlBotDwA run ttl arena start
# The bot stands 5 blocks from a mob spot and does not fight back: the armorsaurus of wave 2 felled it before the test cleared the wave
# (the first full run passed by luck). Resistance keeps it standing; the arena rules stay untouched.
effect give TtlBotDwA minecraft:resistance 200 255 true
@sleep 7
ttl arena expect arena dwarven state fight
ttl arena defeat TtlBotDwB TtlBotDwA
@sleep 2
ttl arena expect arena dwarven result a
ttl arena expect player TtlBotDwA wins 1
ttl arena expect player TtlBotDwB losses 1
@sleep 6
ttl arena expect arena dwarven state free

# ---- challenge: waves only (no boss), clear when the third wave is down -----------------------------------------------
# The wave mobs knocked the bot out of the arena in wave 3 ("left the arena", result partial; test-all 19/11 11:51):
# full knockback resistance keeps it inside, reset at the end.
attribute TtlBotDwA minecraft:generic.knockback_resistance base set 1
execute as TtlBotDwA run ttl arena join dwarven challenge
ttl arena expect arena dwarven mode challenge
execute as TtlBotDwA run ttl arena start
@sleep 7
ttl arena expect arena dwarven state fight
ttl arena expect arena dwarven phase waves
ttl arena expect arena dwarven wave 1
ttl arena wave dwarven clear
@sleep 2
ttl arena expect arena dwarven wave 2
ttl arena wave dwarven clear
@sleep 2
ttl arena expect arena dwarven wave 3
ttl arena wave dwarven clear
@sleep 4
ttl arena expect arena dwarven result clear
ttl arena expect player TtlBotDwA clears 1
@sleep 6
ttl arena expect arena dwarven state free

# ---- clean up --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ttl arena reset
# In four slabs: one fill takes at most 32768 blocks (the single 99450-block fill was refused and cleared nothing).
execute in minecraft:overworld run fill 21000 200 21000 21018 225 21050 minecraft:air
execute in minecraft:overworld run fill 21019 200 21000 21037 225 21050 minecraft:air
execute in minecraft:overworld run fill 21038 200 21000 21056 225 21050 minecraft:air
execute in minecraft:overworld run fill 21057 200 21000 21074 225 21050 minecraft:air
execute in minecraft:overworld run forceload remove 20992 20992 21088 21056
ttl arena clear TtlBotDwA
ttl arena clear TtlBotDwB
kubejs stages remove TtlBotDwA ttl.life2
kubejs stages remove TtlBotDwB ttl.life2
attribute TtlBotDwA minecraft:generic.knockback_resistance base set 0
ttlbot remove TtlBotDwA
ttlbot remove TtlBotDwB
